{"title":"2018 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 Part A","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2018 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Alexandra draws a letter A which stands on the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-axis.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1_Part_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The left side of the letter A lies along the line with equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/9/2a9be1b210be4a436afff9b1354dd77fc24e91a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 3x + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />. What is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-intercept of the line with equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/9/2a9be1b210be4a436afff9b1354dd77fc24e91a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 3x + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1_Part_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-intercept is where the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/b/47b856a3e98d9bfbc086130276cc8ab8a779a415.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = 3x_0 + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/6/0e6d6c98a68157dcd63f7cad6c8b7c9c2d00d06e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x_0 = 0 - 6 = -6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"141\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/4/d843fd392f29820e9c4476acb800fbcdb47cce0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_0 = \\frac{-6}{3} = \\boxed{-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"130\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018062031\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 46/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 165/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1788/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.468      1 2018_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\n100.00%    6.468      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37286:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018062031 and revision id 287932. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}